{
  "info": {
    "name": "PEI - QA04 aislamiento multi-tenant",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Sólo entorno descartable del runner QA04. Reutiliza los UUID de CU06/ID08. No exportar variables de ejecución: contienen credenciales efímeras. QA04-09 exige vacío en lista,404 en detalle y400 al crear, según filtros y DomainException existentes; no admite respuestas alternativas."
  },
  "variable": [],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "SETUP Login Docente A",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{identidadUrl}}/api/auth/login",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\"email\":\"docente@a.test\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP esperado 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Sesión institucional A', () => { const b=pm.response.json(); pm.expect(b.tokenType).to.eql('Bearer'); pm.expect(b.accessToken).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty; pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenA',b.accessToken); const c=JSON.parse(atob(b.accessToken.split('.')[1].replace(/-/g,'+').replace(/_/g,'/'))); pm.expect(c.institucion_id).to.eql(pm.variables.get('tenantA')); pm.expect(c.role).to.eql('Docente'); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "SETUP Login Docente B",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
